{
  "title": "Cryo-ET and Subtomogram averaging Workshop",
  "upload_type": "lesson",
  "description": "<p>The focus of the workshop is to provide training in some of the most recent developments of CryoET and STA data processing using for instance nextPYP, TomoBEAR, Warp/M, taught by the developers themselves. The workshop provides hands-on training in CryoET and STA encompassing all stages of the pipeline.</p>\n<p>Training dates: 2026-12-02 – 2026-12-04.</p>\n<p>Training website: <a href=\"https://cryoem-sweden.github.io/sta-workshop/2612/\">https://cryoem-sweden.github.io/sta-workshop/2612/</a></p>",
